# Flyrank Front-End AI Engineering Internship Rules

## Project Stack

- React
- JavaScript
- Vite
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Node.js
- npm

## Code Conventions

- Use functional React components.
- Use PascalCase for component names.
- Use descriptive names for variables and functions.
- Keep components small and reusable.
- Avoid duplicating existing components.
- Remove unused imports and variables.
- Follow the existing project structure.

## Styling

- Follow the existing styling approach.
- Maintain responsive layouts.
- Reuse existing colors, spacing, and typography.
- Do not introduce a new CSS framework unless requested.

## AI Instructions

- Read relevant files before making changes.
- Do not modify unrelated files.
- Do not remove existing functionality without permission.
- Explain important changes.
- Do not add packages unless they are necessary.
- Do not expose API keys or secrets.
- Check for errors after making changes.
